      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The pipe seems forcefully stretched, its metal cover bent in such a way for a human to easily pass through. Looking inside, you notice that the way is blocked by a large smelly object. Next to the pipe entrance lies a red valve most likely used to operate the flow within the system.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a3" name="=&gt;a3">
