      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Gruesome sounds ensue as you can hear the air flowing through, struggling to clear the obstacle. A few loud snaps away, you quickly notice that those were actually human remains blocking the path. Eventually, the air prevails, flushing the corpse down the pipes, leaving almost nothing behind. After a little while you close the valve.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
